From 89988e97e5d6f4144e61322bea3770cc34894286 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 12:42:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port Prescision control: asymmetric band, min-run,
 skip/force-max, alarm clear

Bring Carel-style compressor hysteresis and min-run from ESP32-Coolroom-Prescision,
plus skip-if-cold / force-max for passive defrost scheduling, and wire alarm clear
hysteresis so latched hi/lo alarms do not chatter on the threshold.
